1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,400
The captain wants the report
on his desk by eight.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,120
Eight? That's in forty minutes.

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,900
<i>He hung up before I could
tell him the lab was backed up.</i>

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,750
Look, I'm not going to
throw you under the bus.

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,400
That's not what I'm worried about.

6
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:17,200
Case 94-1187. Two witnesses,
neither of them talking.

7
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,050
So we've got nothing.

8
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,800
We've got a partial plate and
a nine-year-old's description.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,300
That's not nothing.

10
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,100
- You know what the DA will say.
- I know exactly what she'll say.

11
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,900
"Bring me something I can
take into a courtroom."

12
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,500
Then let's go get it.
